001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     BKREXP.
001300 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
001400*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500*DATE-WRITTEN.   NOVEMBER 1984.
001600*DATE-COMPILED.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.
001900*             PRINTS BLANKET EXPIRATION REPORT.
002000***************************************************************
002100***************************************************************
002200***                    B K R E X P                          ***
002300***                                                         ***
002400***      THIS PROGRAM PRINTS ONE OF THE REPORTS AVAILABLE   ***
002500***      ON A MENU FROM THE UDC "QR2" ON THE OVERALL        ***
002600***      PURCHASING MENU: EXPIRING REQUIREMENTS.            ***
002700***                                                         ***
002800***      THE USER INPUTS 3 OPTIONS BEFORE PRINTING BEGINS:  ***
002900***         1.  REPORT NUMBER                               ***
003000***         2.  NUMBER OF DAYS THE REPORT WILL              ***
003100***             COVER (UP TO 999 DAYS)                      ***
003200***         3.  SORT OPTION                                 ***
003300***              A)  REQUIREMENT NUMBER                     ***
003400***              B)  EXPIRATION DATE                        ***
003500***              C)  VENDOR CODE                            ***
003600***                                                         ***
003700***************************************************************
003800***************************************************************
      *C  09/17/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON COMPARISON OF EXPIRATION DATE.
      *C   ALSO DO THE SORT OF DATE BY CENTURY.  CHANGE
      *C   JUL/GREG DATE ROUTINES TO "JULGREG".
      *C
      *C  09/30/96  WL   MCINTYRE
      *C   CORRECT READ LOGIC FOR PO HEADER FILE TO ENSURE
      *C   COMPLETE SERIAL PROCESSING OF FILE.
      *C
      *C  05JAN1998  DAVE PLUM
      *C   CORRECT THE START LOGIC FOR DVENDOR TO HANDLE THOSE
      *C   CASES WHERE THE VENDOR DOES NOT EXIST.
      *C
003900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
004000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
004100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
004200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
004300 SPECIAL-NAMES.      C01 IS NEWPAGE.
004400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
004500 FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT PRINT-FILE   ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
003200      SELECT SORT-FILE    ASSIGN TO DISK-SORTFILE.
            SELECT DVENDOR-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DPOITEM-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DPORECD-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT MBUYER-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0601
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
