013000     05  LINE2-BUYER-NAME    PIC X(16)   VALUE SPACES.
013100     05  FILLER              PIC X(31)   VALUE SPACES.
013200*----------  CURRENT DATE COMPUTED INTO A JULIAN DATE
013300 01  TODAYS-JULIAN .
           05  TJ-YY                   PIC 9(4).
           05  TJ-DDD                  PIC 9(3).
013400
013500*----------  TODAY'S JULIAN ADDED TO THE DAYS THE REPORT COVERS
